EXTERNAL_TIRE_MODULE_DLL D:\product_dev\trunk\Image\CarSim\Core\CarSim_Prog\Programs\solvers\\mfswift_carsim_2312.dll64
INSTALL_EXTERNAL_TIRE_API ! Command to load the specified external module

! Simcenter Tire MF-Tyre/MF-Swift model: set context in VS model for axle 1, left side
IAXLE  1
ISIDE  1
! Simcenter Tire MF-Tyre/MF-Swift property file and DLL location
DELFT_TYRE_DLL 
DELFT_TYRE_SW   33114 ! Operating mode of Simcenter Tire MF-Tyre/MF-Swift model
DELFT_TYRE_TVM      0 ! Temperature mode of Simcenter Tire MF-Tyre/MF-Swift model
DELFT_TYRE_INIT


